sh. Elevation: IGN RGE ALTI (1 m DTM) via Géoplateforme altimetry API (data.geopf.fr/altimetrie/1.0/calcul/alti/rest/elevation.json, resource ign_rge_alti_wld), sampled every ~12.5 m; tunnel correction: Voie Georges-Pompidou 4290-4352 m (DEM surface up to 34.6 m replaced by 29.26->29.64 m); Avenue du Général Lemonnier 5228-5403 m (DEM surface up to 35.24 m replaced by 30.51->30.15 m); cross-checked with EU-DEM 25 m via OpenTopoData (eudem25m, surface-model noise from trees/buildings, lap climb 70 m so not used). Smoothing: 62 m rolling median + 75 m centred moving average, resampled to ~25 m; grade cap 22% per 25 m step (applied to 0 steps)."}